 <title>Vilhuber appointed to the Committee on Privacy and Confidentiality of the ASA</title>
 <link>https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/news/vilhuber-appointed-committee-privacy-and-confidentiality-asa</link>
 <description>
  &lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;img class=&quot;borealis image-style-focussed_main_image borealis-js&quot; data-borealis-respondsmall=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondsmall/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/Lars-Vilhuber.jpg?itok=ZChuYjXs&quot; data-borealis-respondmedium=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondmedium/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/Lars-Vilhuber.jpg?itok=kc6vV6V2&quot; data-borealis-respondlarge=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondlarge/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/Lars-Vilhuber.jpg?itok=8Ff50unQ&quot; data-borealis-respondxl=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondxl/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/Lars-Vilhuber.jpg?itok=wFRsIonW&quot; data-borealis-respondxl2=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondxl2/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/Lars-Vilhuber.jpg?itok=0AivPvcQ&quot; data-borealis-respondxl3=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondxl3/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/Lars-Vilhuber.jpg?itok=mvf7Q7VX&quot; data-borealis-respondxl4=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondxl4/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/Lars-Vilhuber.jpg?itok=6jIvHaPK&quot; src=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondsmall/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/Lars-Vilhuber.jpg?itok=ZChuYjXs&quot; alt=&quot;Lars Vilhuber&quot;/&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-published-date field-type-datetime field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;date-display-single&quot;&gt;Monday, August 17, 2015&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Dr. Lars Vilhuber, Executive Director of the Labor Dynamics Institute, has been appointed a member of the Committee on Privacy and Confidentiality of the American Statistical Association (ASA). While the appointment is effective Jan 1, 2016, as per the committee&#039;s chairman Dr. Bournazian, Dr. Vilhuber begins serving immediately.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Committee on Privacy and Confidentiality&#039;s website: &lt;a href=&quot;http://community.amstat.org/cpc/home&quot;&gt;http://community.amstat.org/cpc/home&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
