				&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.theatlantic.com/technology/archive/2015/07/fake-data-privacy-census/399974/&quot;&gt;http://www.theatlantic.com/technology/archive/2015/07/fake-data-privacy-census/399974/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

