 <title>Abowd wins 2015 GPSA award for excellence in teaching, advising and mentoring</title>
 <link>https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/news/abowd-wins-2015-gpsa-award-excellence-teaching-advising-and-mentoring</link>
 <description>
  &lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;img class=&quot;borealis image-style-focussed_main_image borealis-js&quot; data-borealis-respondsmall=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondsmall/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/JohnAbowd_RP_7610.jpg?itok=cpPCO5Bl&quot; data-borealis-respondmedium=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondmedium/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/JohnAbowd_RP_7610.jpg?itok=S5Ib3Nbs&quot; data-borealis-respondlarge=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondlarge/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/JohnAbowd_RP_7610.jpg?itok=EeotnMDQ&quot; data-borealis-respondxl=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondxl/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/JohnAbowd_RP_7610.jpg?itok=ervXRWsP&quot; data-borealis-respondxl2=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondxl2/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/JohnAbowd_RP_7610.jpg?itok=rdr6BSsS&quot; data-borealis-respondxl3=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondxl3/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/JohnAbowd_RP_7610.jpg?itok=lJiw99r8&quot; data-borealis-respondxl4=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondxl4/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/JohnAbowd_RP_7610.jpg?itok=trbCPwiC&quot; src=&quot;https://d7-edit.ilr.cornell.edu/sites/default/files/styles/borealis_focussed_main_image_respondsmall/public/fielduploads/node_news_item/image/JohnAbowd_RP_7610.jpg?itok=cpPCO5Bl&quot; alt=&quot;John Abowd &quot;/&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-published-date field-type-datetime field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;date-display-single&quot;&gt;Tuesday, April 28, 2015&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Cornell&#039;s Graduate and Professional Student Assembly has named John Abowd, the Edmund Ezra Day Professor of Economics, as a winner of its 2015 award for excellence in teaching, advising and mentoring.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Awards Committee was impressed and overwhelmed by the enthusiasm and passion with which graduate students have nominated faculty members who have made a positive impact on their academic and professional development. In many cases, these faculty members serve as inspiring role models, champion graduate and professional student interests, and go above and beyond in their commitment to furthering their students&#039; personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Winners of the 2015 Faculty Awards: John Abowd, Economics; Durba Gosh, History; and Mattius Liepe, Physics.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ILRSchool/photos/a.168216809867510.30959.122623604426831/914075268614990/?type=1&amp;amp;theater&quot;&gt;ILR Facebook announcement&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ILRSchool&quot;&gt;ILR Facebook page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
